  "title": "PathAgentBench",
  "summary": "PathAgentBench introduces a unified framework for evaluating evidence-seeking vision-language models (VLMs) across four complementary capabilities: image-to-text matching for evidence interpretation, text-to-image retrieval for evidence verification, diagnostic-region localization for evidence acquisition, and multi-scale reasoning for evidence integration. It contains 1,822 TCGA WSIs and 17,135 diagnostic paths annotated by ten board-certified pathologists.",
  "facts": [
